export anchor ConstructivistStyle:
    number: 50
    screen: Pricing
    name: Constructivist
    idea: An avant-garde propaganda poster in red, black and cream, where tilted slabs, heavy condensed capitals and solid arrows drive the eye from plan to button.
    base: light
    palette:
        cream: #f2e8d5, the page ground
        paper: #faf4e6, plan slabs, question boxes and the style sheet
        red: #b3121b, the hero slab, plan heads, the primary button, arrows and the badge
        black: #141414, text, frames, the top bar, the featured plan, the table band and focus
        umber: #6b5e4e, secondary labels on cream
        stone: #d8ccb4, large ghost numerals and the caption on black
        oxide: #2a1416, the Team column in the black table
    type:
        Display is Impact, Haettenschweiler, Franklin Gothic Condensed,
        Oswald, Barlow Condensed, Arial Narrow, DejaVu Sans Condensed,
        sans-serif, bold and always uppercase. Text is Franklin Gothic
        Medium, Arial Narrow, Arial, sans-serif at semibold. The title is up
        to 210px on a 0.9 line, prices are 112px, plan names 52px, section
        titles 72px, controls 24 to 26px and body 17px.
    layout:
        A black top bar with a red square logo and the current nav item on
        a red block. The hero is a full width red slab rotated minus 6
        degrees that carries the title, half cream and half black, crossed
        by a black disc and a thin black diagonal bar, with a short boxed
        line below at the right. A square billing switch is followed by a
        bar arrow pointing to a tilted red 2 months free tag. Three plan
        slabs sit edge to edge with 4px black frames, each stepped 48px
        lower than the last. Each has a head cut on a diagonal, a huge
        price, triangle bullets and a ghost numeral. The comparison sits on
        a black band whose top edge is cut on a slant, and the questions
        sit beside a big red title rotated to read upward. Below 900px the
        plans stack with small sideways offsets and the title stops
        rotating.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 20px inside slabs and 40 to 72px between blocks.
    density: Loud and medium. Few words, huge figures and short bold lists.
    corners: Square, except one black disc. Plan heads and swatches are cut on a diagonal.
    borders: 4px solid black on every box, 2px rules between list items and rows, and 6px red under the table head.
    shadows: Only a hard 6px black offset block behind the primary button, cream on the black plan. No blur.
    icons:
        Solid geometric shapes. Bar and triangle arrows on buttons,
        triangles as list bullets and included marks, a flat bar for not
        included, a star on the badge and a triangle on the chosen billing
        option.
    focus: A 4px black outline offset 3px with a cream gap. A focused field turns its frame red and gains a 16px left slab.
    tone: Short commands in capitals, such as Pick one and Plan against plan.
